This CLI was hand-built by ek-labs for the Printing Press library
(https://github.com/mvanhorn/printing-press-library), following the
printing-press conventions for agent-native CLIs (token-efficient output,
--agent mode, MCP surface, safety-gated writes). It was not produced by the
CLI Printing Press generator; see .printing-press.json and
.manuscripts/ for build provenance. A standalone edition is maintained at
https://github.com/ek-labs/pp-mt5 under the pp-mt5 name.

This tool drives MetaTrader 5 through the MetaTrader5 Python package.
